# Large nsys capture binaries — regeneratable by run_halo_profile.sh.
# The committed evidence is the extracted *_sum*.csv tables (small)
# plus FINDINGS.md; the raw .nsys-rep / .sqlite are ~100-200 MB each
# and are intentionally NOT vendored.
*.nsys-rep
*.sqlite

# Per-cell SFINCS output (large; regeneratable). Unanchored so the
# pattern also catches the verify-4d/ run subdirs.
sfincs_map.nc
sfincs_his.nc
__pycache__

# Per-cell symlinks back to tests/cases/<case>/ source inputs.
# stage_case() symlinks the forcing / grid files so the SFINCS binary
# can read them without copying; the symlinks must not enter git (they
# would resolve outside the tree or duplicate the source case bytes).
# sfincs.inp is a real copy (length-modified) and is NOT excluded.
# Unanchored basenames so both the top-level profiled cell and the
# nested verify-4d/<cell>/ dirs are covered.
sfincs.dep
sfincs.msk
sfincs.bnd
sfincs.bzs
sfincs.amu
sfincs.amv
sfincs.prcp
sfincs.psi
sfincs.sigma
sfincs.ks
sfincs.scs
sfincs.src
sfincs.dis
sfincs.weir
sfincs.nc
sfincs_subgrid.nc
snapwave.*
